### star-plan-executor/references/agent_dispatch_spec.md
--- 1
# Agent Dispatch Brief
+++ 1
# Agent Dispatch Brief (Cursor Task)
### star-plan-executor/references/agent_dispatch_spec.md
--- 1
One `Task` subagent per step (or coherent step-group) in EXEC_PLAN. Prefer `subagent_type: explore`; use `Explore` with `model: sonnet` only for read-only orientation. The main agent orchestrates and verifies; the agent does the edit/run for exactly one step — narrow, so failures localize and contexts stay short.
+++ 1
One `Task` subagent per step (or coherent step-group) in EXEC_PLAN. A step that edits or runs is dispatched with no `subagent_type` set; use `subagent_type: explore` only for read-only orientation. The main agent orchestrates and verifies; the agent does the edit/run for exactly one step — narrow, so failures localize and contexts stay short.
### star-plan-executor/references/agent_dispatch_spec_zh.md
--- 1
# Agent 交办说明
+++ 1
# Agent 交办说明（Cursor Task）
### star-plan-executor/references/agent_dispatch_spec_zh.md
--- 1
EXEC_PLAN 里每个步骤(或每个连贯步骤组)派一个 `Task` subagent（`subagent_type: explore`；只读勘察可用 `Explore`）。主 agent 负责编排与验证;agent 只做这一步的改/跑——只管一小块,以便失败可定位、上下文短。
+++ 1
EXEC_PLAN 里每个步骤(或每个连贯步骤组)用 `Task` 派一个 subagent。要改文件或跑命令的步骤不设 `subagent_type`;只读勘察用 `subagent_type: explore`。主 agent 负责编排与验证;agent 只做这一步的改/跑——只管一小块,以便失败可定位、上下文短。
### star-plan-reviser/SKILL.md
--- 1
2. **Collect wide, judge in the main agent.** Evidence gathering is delegated to parallel **read-only `Task` subagents** (`subagent_type: explore`) (execution log / artifacts / code state), each returning the structured collector format in `references/review_spec.md`. Collectors never write and never propose revisions; synthesis and judgment stay in the main agent.
+++ 1
